{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":265321,\"title\":\"A Shred Of Mist\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"After the dead of his mother, Daniel is put under the care of his aunt Elizabeth, a foreign woman with a severe character, who subjects the child to multiple abuses and psychological torture.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1cy71eeNjdhbTZSVkOa24fsAHyQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3hJQjteP1x8GfwTWK9afHUmC99l.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"voteCount\":9,\"year\":2014,\"runtime\":90,\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"MX\",\"name\":\"Mexico\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Julio César Estrada\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1137857,\"name\":\"Julio César Estrada\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1310894,\"name\":\"José Ángel Bichir\",\"character\":\"Daniel\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m0nvrYbjWPCK0FQ8F09cuXnMH64.jpg\"},{\"id\":955272,\"name\":\"María Rojo\",\"character\":\"Tía Elizabeth\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ybAqZhtCHX9Rd26kNWxjeZPWjYV.jpg\"},{\"id\":971924,\"name\":\"Alejandro Felipe\",\"character\":\"Daniel (young)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n03DoSQBwwRVmvzh4Sm3sMpOnSG.jpg\"},{\"id\":1310895,\"name\":\"Andrea Verdeja\",\"character\":\"Patricia\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oAeKYv9CQV761wHuV5o2lnSlQr8.jpg\"},{\"id\":17689,\"name\":\"Gerardo Taracena\",\"character\":\"Perito\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wvqDQf71ezlA36ZzhWe1D7cKLLS.jpg\"},{\"id\":7368,\"name\":\"Ernesto Gómez Cruz\",\"character\":\"Doctor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kjhWqt1ZXZrXPtJftCGSv6Ypvpw.jpg\"},{\"id\":932160,\"name\":\"Arcelia Ramírez\",\"character\":\"Irasema\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5SA0Oj5t9qp4Ck18xj6pMKZXBsW.jpg\"},{\"id\":76857,\"name\":\"Joaquín Cosío\",\"character\":\"Vega\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ijMo3fMyY4VL1xyIj6ytiJrzaw9.jpg\"},{\"id\":4465350,\"name\":\"Luis Alfonso Moreno\",\"character\":\"Niño de la Escuela\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xGYIhIc2d5ijgTRxBVOjyF9EbiG.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":282035,\"title\":\"The Mummy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zxkY8byBnCsXodEYpK8tmwEGXBI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i4ZougHEyBAboDpi6jsaTUDTjUl.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Though safely entombed in a crypt deep beneath the unforgiving desert, an ancient queen whose destiny was unjustly taken from her is awakened in our current day, bringing with her malevolence grown over millennia, and terrors that defy human comprehension.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Thriller\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":43947,\"title\":\"I Spit on Your Grave\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sD5mBllYcBR5sQTyR2VGYhpHf6B.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f4QIQvecRkKD5t7aPclyIr3SEP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A beautiful woman from the city, Jennifer Hills, rents an isolated cabin in the country to write her latest novel. Soon, a group of local lowlifes subject her to a nightmare of degradation, rape, and violence.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9378,\"title\":\"Thir13en Ghosts\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6yrrddjIjx0ElCRZp5pTZeqrj3k.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x30bpi16AFWrfGVhYMqujbcCAWS.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Arthur and his two children inherit his uncle's estate: a glass house that serves as a prison to twelve ghosts. When the family, accompanied by a nanny and an attorney, enter the house they find themselves trapped inside an evil machine 'designed by the Devil and powered by the dead' to open the Eye of Hell. Aided by a ghost hunter and his rival, a ghost rights activist out to set the ghosts free, the group must do what they can to get out of the house alive.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9792,\"title\":\"The Hills Have Eyes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2eJL1Ccr1FN3dm9OSDwyd8uaX1b.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vrFI0I3M8ROZduj9XbFDoQKZyao.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on Wes Craven's 1977 suspenseful cult classic, The Hills Have Eyes is the story of a family road trip that goes terrifyingly awry when the travelers become stranded in a government atomic zone. Miles from nowhere, the Carter family soon realizes the seemingly uninhabited wasteland is actually the breeding ground of a blood-thirsty mutant family...and they are the prey.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":570670,\"title\":\"The Invisible Man\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5EufsDwXdY2CVttYOk2WtYhgKpa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tweDJNQzBGgsWVF5MC8JhSAk07p.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Cecilia's abusive ex takes his own life and leaves her his fortune, she suspects his death was a hoax. As a series of coincidences turn lethal, Cecilia works to prove that she is being hunted by someone nobody can see.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4858,\"title\":\"The Invasion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oS5rMuJXwNZZPx0ojhvjgduglD2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nPpIFyRRe33xKUj3nEHZZbz364x.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Washington, D.C. psychologist Carol Bennell and her colleague Dr. Ben Driscoll are the only two people on Earth who are aware of an epidemic running rampant through the city. They discover an alien virus aboard a crashed space shuttle that transforms anyone who comes into contact with it into unfeeling drones while they sleep. Carol realizes her son holds the key to stopping the spread of the plague and she races to find him before it is too late.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10066,\"title\":\"House of Wax\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aCLSgw1DaqkRvosYc3YUttBTtpT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2J7re6BvXXxLFXCYZpTUmRKkTHn.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of unwitting teens are stranded near a strange wax museum and soon must fight to survive and keep from becoming the next exhibit.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":18405,\"title\":\"The Last House on the Left\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Y35XCUS8U8vC8vs0HDEVkPu1BM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iiMR0RygNN3GTy8mjZOzXc5Q4jx.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When athletic teen Mari Collingwood opts to hang out with her friend Paige in town rather than spend an evening in with her parents vacationing at the family's remote lake house, it marks the beginning of a night no one is going to forget.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1970,\"title\":\"The Grudge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7vPAVPKYexQVmvC578wPLn2CGCL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wUAQ3PZlxAW6q1p0tQSWanYnJiA.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An American nurse living and working in Tokyo is exposed to a mysterious supernatural curse, one that locks a person in a powerful rage before claiming their life and spreading to another victim.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1114513,\"title\":\"Speak No Evil\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dA4N6uWOnEMgbxXwFX7qX7adzs8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1fL2S8LKxCVE9KoPRBXeagmBtex.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When an American family is invited to spend the weekend at the idyllic country estate of a charming British family they befriended on vacation, what begins as a dream holiday soon warps into a snarled psychological nightmare.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":710295,\"title\":\"Wolf Man\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wpSDzTBfF0Eeo5lzu2w9FTujGqd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wwARk7hRIfHfh2n2ubN6N7lvTne.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"With his marriage fraying, Blake persuades his wife Charlotte to take a break from the city and visit his remote childhood home in rural Oregon. As they arrive at the farmhouse in the dead of night, they're attacked by an unseen animal and barricade themselves inside the home as the creature prowls the perimeter. But as the night stretches on, Blake begins to behave strangely, transforming into something unrecognizable.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":23437,\"title\":\"A Nightmare on Elm Street\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nsmW28GcNabCUZfP5YtUEe8Li0f.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Aur8dDhjDDJBuSDa9Y9GNrvlPI5.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Teenagers Nancy, Quentin, Kris, Jesse and Dean are all neighbourhood friends who begin having the same dream of a horribly disfigured man who wears a tattered sweater and a glove made of knives. The man terrorises them in their dreams, and the only escape is to wake up. But when, one by one, they start dying violently, the friends realise that what happens in the dream world is real, and the only way to stay alive is to stay awake.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"LhCKXJNGzN8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"nM56RubwTHg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"kya_uqiSQOY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}